Tanatswa Nzira — Portfolio Website
A personal portfolio website for web and graphic designer Tanatswa Nzira. It introduces the designer, showcases experience and projects, and links to social profiles and a CV.
Website sections
- About: Introduction, role, CV link, and social links
- Experience: Content creation, freelance design, and other roles
- Projects: Selected graphic design and website work
- Contact: Contact section
Files
Keep the HTML file together with its supporting assets:
- style.css — page styling
- script.js — interactive behavior
- tan1.png, pro1.jpg, pro2.jpeg, and pro3.png — profile and project images
The page also loads Lexend and Oswald fonts from Google Fonts and icons from Font Awesome.
